   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Given that <span data-math=\"{l_1}\">{l_1}</span> and <span data-math=\"{l_2}\">{l_2}</span> are parallel lines, solve the angle measurements for all the angles in the given figure.<br>\n\n<img src=\"exercises/media/9c5f072f91a0f22b.png\" alt=\"Two lines, l subscript 1 and l subscript 2 are intersected by a transversal. The transversal makes four angles labeled 1, 2, 3, and 150 degrees with the line, l subscript 1. The transversal makes four angles numbered 5, 6, 7, and 8 with the line, l subscript 2. 1, 2, 7, and 8 are exterior angles. 3, 150 degrees, 5, and 6 are interior angles.\">\n",
